{"product_id":"dtf-transfers","title":"DTF Transfers","description":"\u003cp data-path-to-node=\"0\"\u003eExperience the next level of garment customization with \u003cb data-path-to-node=\"0\" data-index-in-node=\"56\"\u003ePremium DTF (Direct to Film) Transfers\u003c\/b\u003e by Patch Kraze. Designed for decorators who demand perfection, our transfers offer a seamless way to apply high-resolution, full-color designs to any fabric.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-path-to-node=\"1\"\u003eBy combining cutting-edge printing technology with a localized supply chain, we’ve eliminated the long wait times and high costs typically associated with custom apparel.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr data-path-to-node=\"2\"\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-path-to-node=\"3\"\u003e\u003cb data-path-to-node=\"3\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"\u003eWhy Choose Patch Kraze DTF?\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul data-path-to-node=\"4\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp data-path-to-node=\"4,0,0\"\u003e\u003cb data-path-to-node=\"4,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"\u003eUnbeatable Quality:\u003c\/b\u003e Our transfers feature vibrant, true-to-life colors and incredible stretchability. They are engineered to endure 50+ wash cycles without cracking, peeling, or fading.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp data-path-to-node=\"4,1,0\"\u003e\u003cb data-path-to-node=\"4,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"\u003eBest Price in the Market:\u003c\/b\u003e We pride ourselves on offering the most competitive pricing available, ensuring you get commercial-grade results without the commercial-grade price tag.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp data-path-to-node=\"4,2,0\"\u003e\u003cb data-path-to-node=\"4,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"\u003eFast American Shipping:\u003c\/b\u003e Skip the overseas delays. With our production facility located right here in \u003cb data-path-to-node=\"4,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"101\"\u003eAmerica\u003c\/b\u003e, we offer lightning-fast turnaround times to